        <mxCell id="p3-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Producer-Side Pattern&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font size='2' color='#555'&gt;P3 sits on the source side.&lt;br/&gt;Consumer uses P1 or P2.&lt;/font&gt;"
